<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak BSE closed for May 1 holiday.</title>
<headline>Slovak BSE closed for May 1 holiday.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-05-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bratislava Stock Exchange was closed on Thursday as the country celebrates the May 1 holiday.</p>
<p>On Wednesday, Slovak blue chips closed mostly higher in thinner trading, boosting the 16-share SAX index 0.27 points to 194.47.</p>
</text>
